{"default":{"entry":{"id":"hy4-CDU1027","title":"图书馆开闭馆音乐征集","kind":"notice","category":"creative","category_label":"文化创作","summary":"为图书馆开闭馆推荐音乐，每人可推荐两首，通过线上投票评选。","tags":["文化创作","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-81d32b8a08d0b08e1c958991","year":2025,"published":"2025-10-20","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","deadline_precision":null,"deadline_status":null,"deadline_note":"","stage_status":null,"stage_note":"","stage_start":null,"stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["unknown"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"现有标题未明确级别，暂不推定。","audience":"","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":""},"source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-81d32b8a08d0b08e1c958991","year":2025,"published":"2025-10-20","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","deadline_precision":null,"deadline_status":null,"deadline_note":"","stage_status":null,"stage_note":"","stage_start":null,"stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["unknown"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"现有标题未明确级别，暂不推定。","audience":"","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":""},"source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":4,"content_profile":{"schema_version":"activity-profile-1","processed_on":"2026-10-17","status":"partial","sections":[{"kind":"other","title":"参与信息","items":[{"text":"晨光洒上书籍时，若有一段旋律，轻轻拂过耳畔。暮色漫进窗棂时，若有一行音符，为你收拢思绪。图书馆的晨昏，当与音乐同行。各位小橙子们，将你想要在图书馆听到的开闭馆音乐分享出来吧。","locator":"正文第1段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"征集要求","locator":"正文第2段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"1.优美动听，舒缓轻松，以中文、英文和纯音乐为主，歌曲正能量。","locator":"正文第3段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"2.以音乐名称+学院+专业+姓名+学号+手机号的形式填写到问卷上。","locator":"正文第4段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"3.每人可推荐两首。我们将采用线上投票的评选方式选出歌曲。我们将对投票数量高的前七位开馆音乐与闭馆音乐的推荐者（共14人）发放奖品。","locator":"正文第5段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"4. 征集时间","locator":"正文第6段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"10月20日-10月26日","locator":"正文第7段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"投稿方式","locator":"正文第8段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"微信公众号扫码填写问卷","locator":"正文第9段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"官方QQ（3441254429）投稿","locator":"正文第10段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"扫码参与","locator":"正文第11段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"特别提醒","locator":"正文第13段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"部分歌曲多次在开闭馆音乐征集的活动中出现，在2025年的开闭馆音乐征集活动中，下述歌曲将不再进入投票范围。","locator":"正文第14段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"},{"text":"1.遇见 2.夜空中最亮的星 3.我们的明天 4.我记得 5.稻香 6.我成为我的同时 7.一路山程 8.像风一样 9.光年之外 10.勋章 11.晴天 12.起风了 13.送你一朵小红花 14.去有风的地方 15.我的未来式 16.想见你想见你想见你 17.反方向的钟 18.平凡的一天 19.平凡 20.入海 21.日落大道 22.你一定能够成为你想要去成为的人 23.无名的人 24.如愿 25.裂缝中的阳光 26.晚安 27.这世界那么多人","locator":"正文第15段","source_url":"https://lib.cdu.edu.cn/info/1007/2467.htm"}]}],"attachments":[],"pending":["参与对象本批未提取到","条件限制本批未提取到","地点本批未提取到","报名步骤本批未提取到","材料本批未提取到","日程本批未提取到","活动内容本批未提取到","费用与奖励本批未提取到","岗位职责本批未提取到"],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"b